      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_18mbs",
        "lines": [
          "Van Fleet's Eighth Army in Korea in 1951 relied on registered artillery",
          "fire and forward ammunition stocks. Deliberate infantry assaults",
          "gain prepared fire superiority at the cost of movement speed and a",
          "heavier supply burden."
        ],
        "height": 72,
        "limit": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "check": "native_text_field_fit:mdcw_mobile_raiding_warfare:name",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_20bs",
        "lines": [
          "Mobile Raiding",
          "Warfare"
        ],
        "height": 40,
        "limit": 50
      }
    },
    {
      "check": "native_text_field_fit:mdcw_mobile_raiding_warfare:description",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_18mbs",
        "lines": [
          "South African battle groups of the 1970s and 1980s used rapid",
          "concentration, flanking movement and withdrawal across wide",
          "spaces. Forward loads sustain short advances, while fixed fronts",
          "expose weaker defence and limited battle preparation."
        ],
        "height": 72,
        "limit": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "check": "native_text_field_fit:mdcw_cohesive_unit_rotation:name",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_20bs",
        "lines": [
          "Cohesive Unit",
          "Rotation"
        ],
        "height": 40,
        "limit": 50
      }
    },
    {
      "check": "native_text_field_fit:mdcw_cohesive_unit_rotation:description",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_18mbs",
        "lines": [
          "British unit rotation and the later American COHORT programme",
          "kept crews and companies together through training and service.",
          "Stable teams preserve experience and cohesion, but require longer",
          "training and a costlier personnel system."
        ],
        "height": 72,
        "limit": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "check": "native_text_field_fit:mdcw_integrated_support_commands:name",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_20bs",
        "lines": [
          "Integrated Support",
          "Commands"
        ],
        "height": 40,
        "limit": 50
      }
    },
    {
      "check": "native_text_field_fit:mdcw_integrated_support_commands:description",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_18mbs",
        "lines": [
          "Logistical commands in Korea and corps support commands in the",
          "1960s united supply, workshops, recovery and medical services.",
          "Integrated support sustains the fighting force, but needs more",
          "personnel and slows the march column."
        ],
        "height": 72,
        "limit": 80
      }
    },
    {
      "check": "native_text_field_fit:mdcw_forest_envelopment:name",
      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_20bs",
        "lines": [
          "Forest",
          "Envelopment"
        ],
        "height": 40,
        "limit": 50
