      "passed": true,
      "detail": {
        "font": "hoi_18mbs",
        "lines": [
          "Rhodesian Fireforce operations from 1974 linked small",
          "helicopter-borne blocking groups with reconnaissance and follow-up",
          "forces. Equipped air-assault infantry gains mobility and cohesion, but",
          "aircraft upkeep and fuel demand increase."
        ],
        "height": 72,
        "limit": 80
      }
    },
    {
